# Paste Supabase SQL in chat

Whenever you create or update a Supabase migration / seed SQL file the user needs to run, **paste the full SQL into the chat** in a fenced `sql` code block so they can copy-paste it into the Supabase SQL editor.

Do this every time — do not only point at the file path.
